    "text": "Ann Arbor\n2 long-time Ann Arbor educators who died this month remembered for impact on youth\nBy Jackie Smith,1 hours ago\nANN ARBOR, MI – The Ann Arbor area school community is mourning the deaths of two long-time educators who loved ones and supporters say had a big impact on local youths. One of them was also about to retire after three decades in the classroom, while the other just finished a degree to teach.\nComments\nLoading editor...",
